{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "640553d4fc6b8096b5eeb4a0a09bab0eb9a8281e8fca15119ffb0b1003ee5c43", "ja": "くんくん……。\nなんだか、甘い匂いがする……。", "zh": "（闻闻……）\n好像有一股甜味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "a65f21594e601e14a9004d1b3854d055c5cc965429e2cf6cb4982baf12ecbf76", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　よかった～。\nやっぱり、どら焼きにつられちゃったんですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！太好了～\n你果然是被铜锣烧引过来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9a256fde1c4a6eeaa93a16da9177c2e03f71b9583dd8e7306e361820e65b4a86", "ja": "いい匂いがしたので、つい。\nこれは、どら焼きの匂いだったんですね。", "zh": "我闻到很香的味道，就忍不住走过来了。\n原来这是铜锣烧的味道啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "917c5f26b6bd0d1af2341ed94c077b639a0cfc5cf93112684c3133ba2a71aa66", "ja": "はい♪　あっ、社長さんが{$P$}さん\nを探してて……。事務所に行ってもらえますか？", "zh": "是的♪啊，社长正在找{$P$}先生……\n可以请你去一趟事务所吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "6d38a7cf2a076dc86d70c5fc2ce6f7ee5e132b7ff7ce6d912265f007a626efac", "ja": "ついでに、差し入れのどら焼きを\n届けてもらえると助かります！", "zh": "如果能顺便把这盒铜锣烧慰劳品送过去，\n那就太感谢你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1030", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "接受", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "abfc621a72e656651bbf09002b9c2c12c8695dc4709032be9355687e9951d9e1", "ja": "もちろん{$P$}さんも\n一緒に食べてくださいね♪", "zh": "至于{$P$}先生，\n当然也要跟大家一起吃喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "67f2748453a840c0d0aac0d90a693acea098f901866583ea1d4b4a8b22ac74f7", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nそれじゃ、行ってきます。", "zh": "谢谢！那我出发了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1007_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "645837c1a9fe2e25eda5e33d7606e1c1ccb761f5ec95b322e4014077f4a46221", "ja": "失礼します。", "zh": "打扰了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "075c4ff851491e9cd0c8f473e65f504a29a7b8ce3c7149ce6df65e7f1651befa", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}さん。\nあら？　なんだかいい匂いがしますけど……。", "zh": "早安，{$P$}先生。\n哎呀？好像有一股香味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d3e4d80d48c2d49df47eae950eeb3b6705a13f3251ee7ffd430a4254d479d55a", "ja": "わかりますか？\n劇場に届いた差し入れのどら焼きなんですけど……。", "zh": "你闻到了吗？\n这是送到剧场来的慰劳品铜锣烧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "84c48794b181759cdce43a8b837cd6cfc5e51df7e904d06f3e21bdb4d8417efd", "ja": "わぁ、美味しそうなどら焼き！\nすぐにお茶を淹れてきますね♪", "zh": "哇，这盒铜锣烧好像很好吃！\n我立刻去泡茶喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "c227779ce5e8611a8787131d3471eebe85d27faaab50820f29c685dd945a9a0a", "ja": "おっ、君。来てくれたんだね。\nしかも手土産つきとは、気が利くじゃないか。", "zh": "哦，你来了呀。\n而且还有带伴手礼，真是贴心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "b78b59715be973e5e2ed2d04dc7fc0b76f6f217bfbe86369aca4b6e5c96722df", "ja": "やはり、できる男は気遣いも一流だ！\n早速、食べながら話をするとしよう。", "zh": "杰出男人的贴心程度果然也是一流！\n我们马上边吃边谈吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "4da2471770acf193e106f2792f5b592b85c8d7340629954479f89075c2804aca", "ja": "うむ、実に美味いどら焼きだね！　オーソドックスな\n見た目でありながら、新しい味わいがある……。", "zh": "嗯，这铜锣烧实在是非常美味！\n外观很传统，味道却相当新颖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "6733597eba98715d79b4e7016dbb9e39447fd049efaf437d5a3fd9bee386e6c4", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、どうぞ。\nお持たせですけど……ふふっ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也请用。\n虽然本来就是你拿来的……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4252f5e06af45e75575f86cd0353fad9a86258beadbd3b329d837ddbf010bcf4", "ja": "はい、いただきます！\nところで社長、本題ですが……。", "zh": "好的，那我不客气了！\n对了，社长要跟我说的正事是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "095b53820f85249d78102ea1297798027386ec4d1e1d0f986e5428c2cbb7fa88", "ja": "ああ、そうだった。\n心配しなくても、ちゃんと覚えているよ。", "zh": "哦，是有这么一回事。\n你不用担心，我有好好记在心里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "ba41c48593be45415dbb20ea12358d76cb56f52198501523424a2de76c998a56", "ja": "我が765プロでは、これまでいくつかのユニットを\n送り出してきたが、どれも大成功と言っていいだろう。", "zh": "我们765艺能至今已推出好几组团体，\n每一组都堪称获得了极大的成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "f1da6bdeaf94b66616d346cbff0b6468b838dbd705e05a5ab1940e6eab1332c2", "ja": "これも、アイドル諸君と君の頑張りのおかげだ。\nいつもありがとう。", "zh": "这都要归功于你和诸位偶像的努力。\n一直以来真的很感谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "72011e87eac523634567a98329e140e7679433f26c03a2ed534457d0fa4a40e5", "ja": "{$P$}さんもアイドルのみんなも、\n本当に頑張ってますものね。", "zh": "因为{$P$}先生跟偶像们\n真的都相当努力嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "74ba1348f328629f74a7cfe55b4e88d78888ce153d8aac1d3d364dc5cfd16372", "ja": "そこでだ……ここで、もっと先、\n更なる高みを目指してみたいと思わないかね！？", "zh": "所以……走到这一步了，\n你想不想再迈向更高的境界呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d794d46ca0903a9f5ac5f28fba1dfa1b64b285bb001c7059e209070fbb58a5c3", "ja": "更なる高み……ですか？", "zh": "更高的境界……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "b42497afa0c37a58070e318dcad1e550e84f2185bf36e8d7a49cb4b1914069b7", "ja": "これから君には、この劇場に、\n新たな伝説を誕生させてほしいと思っている！", "zh": "接下来我想交给你的工作就是，\n让这间剧场诞生新的传说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "453c8f814f7b349b65446f776da2e9cea1af6fde91ae89631f86e7b168452dfd", "ja": "新たな伝説……！", "zh": "新的传说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "5c057d42c1f17538a901ef6433f346d2313c42efda828fc6e04c5a812900a7c5", "ja": "そして、新たな伝説となるユニットの名前は\n『BIRTH』！", "zh": "而即将要成为新传说的团体，\n就叫做『BIRTH』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "83bd23293e425cb7fbe526768a75d44e3741674180604efa31b3ad6a71f83627", "ja": "メンバーは萩原雪歩君、舞浜歩君、三浦あずさ君、\n矢吹可奈君。そしてリーダーに菊地真君だ。", "zh": "成员有萩原雪步、舞滨步、三浦梓、矢吹可奈，\n队长则是菊地真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "ee37673b60d1fd5b06e9efe58da93cea140e911a8c502247574e4490e8d44eb2", "ja": "どうかね？　一体どんなユニットになるのか、\nワクワクしてこないかね？", "zh": "如何？你不会觉得很兴奋，\n想知道她们会成为什么样的团体吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "c52738eb3016b9ccf28c88b040cf3c257d8edf6458084d9d92a6bb86ce7053b1", "ja": "BIRTH……まさに伝説の誕生ですね。\nこのメンバーなら、きっとできると思います！", "zh": "『BIRTH』……正是象征着传说的诞生呢。\n有这些成员在，一定能成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_1029", "source_sha256": "a6536599ceb763c26c3c0c8d1475141bd6e072aec2e452837edf417e39d8e7e0", "ja": "任せてください", "zh": "请交给我", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "02effb09b866796b551b9b9c63ee45a3f7393d419723acd9722aed64086b91b6", "ja": "任せてください！\n劇場に、新しい伝説を生み出してみせます！", "zh": "请交给我吧！\n我一定会让剧场诞生新的传说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "814ce3714b737d2fbd258d0130cd6d1e7fd44f6e7d748c4a0e0ab9f1f6937e10", "ja": "うむ、その意気だ。\nでは、頼んだよ、君！", "zh": "嗯，就是要有这种决心。\n那就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_2002_p", "source_sha256": "6671f382ae35efc55b93529a15556eb4e3e537d83f60e6ca1bfd286e00ee5290", "ja": "（アイドルとしてスタートしたばかりの可奈と歩。\n着実に経験を積んできた真、雪歩、あずささん……）", "zh": "（可奈与步的偶像星路才刚起步，\n真、雪步与梓小姐则不断踏实累积经验至今……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "66ca29f0ac3e59ac2e1580241d91cdbf1bdc3c86bad2d3bf9817d9428a5d9a52", "ja": "（5人の個性がぶつかりあった時、一体、\n何が生まれるのか……それを早く見てみたいな）", "zh": "（这五个人的性格究竟会碰撞出什么火花……\n真想快点看看呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
